      "persona": "Universal Persona Content",
      "taskMessage": "<b>Ed:</b> The status notice, DNS record, and host check now give us a connected trail. The next question is what we want this evidence to achieve.\n\nMichele can help turn it into a repair request for the service owner. Ana can help explain the impact to the people who depend on the portal and press for a clear response.",
      "taskInstructions": "",
      "taskQuestion": "",
      "taskCompleteText": "<b>Ed:</b> We have enough to choose a direction. Think about whether you want to lead with a repair request or with accountability to the people affected."
    }
